{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game transports players into a colorful world. In this world, players use the A and D keys to control the fruit basket at the bottom of the screen and catch various fruits falling from above. Each type of fruit corresponds to a different score. The more fruits players catch, the higher their cumulative score will be.The game graphics are fresh and bright, with a harmonious color scheme, giving people a relaxed and pleasant feeling. The game interface is lively and cheerful, and when combined with the cool visuals of catching fruits, it provides an excellent gaming experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3583870?t=1742732684","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3583870?t=1742732684","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583870/ebebcc6f799098a5c620365d003bb0b6e674fa9e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742732684","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583870/ebebcc6f799098a5c620365d003bb0b6e674fa9e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742732684","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game transports players into a colorful world. In this world, players use the A and D keys to control the fruit basket at the bottom of the screen and catch various fruits falling from above. Each type of fruit corresponds to a different score. The more fruits players catch, the higher their cumulative score will be.The game graphics are fresh and bright, with a harmonious color scheme, giving people a relaxed and pleasant feeling. The game interface is lively and cheerful, and when combined with the cool visuals of catching fruits, it provides an excellent gaming experience.</p>","developers":["Define"],"genres"